Subject: [PATCH] tsi: guard IPv6 UDP lookup when IPv6 is unavailable

TSI depends on INET, not IPV6. Avoid referencing the IPv6 UDP lookup
implementation when IPv6 is disabled or not reachable from TSI, so
IPv4-only firmware can retain TSI support.

--- a/net/tsi/af_tsi.c
+++ b/net/tsi/af_tsi.c
@@ -1122,7 +1122,7 @@
 			sock_put(listener);  /* Release the reference */
 			return true;
 		}
-	} else if (tsk->family == PF_INET6) {
+	} else if (IS_REACHABLE(CONFIG_IPV6) && tsk->family == PF_INET6) {
 		struct sockaddr_in6 *sin6;
 		const struct in6_addr *daddr;
 		__be16 dport;
